    {
      "id": "former-shu-song-guangsi-zongbi-relays-zongchou-threat",
      "title": "听宗弼转述宗俦欲除己而伏谢",
      "summary": "王宗俦忧愤死后，王宗弼向宋光嗣、景润澄等称宗俦曾教他杀他们，如今已无后患；宋光嗣等伏地泣谢。",
      "year": 924,
      "sortOrder": 6,
      "precision": "month",
      "sourceDate": "乾德六年九月，庚戌记王宗俦卒；宋等伏谢未独记日",
      "phase": "service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v273",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v273-p57",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "054e1f335a71bca53dd8b65590b86dcc99401cc4d01ac0bbcf5665f5167493d0",
          "excerpt": "蜀前山南節度使兼中書令王宗儔以蜀主失德，與王宗弼謀廢立，宗弼猶豫未決。庚戌，宗儔憂憤而卒。宗弼謂樞密使宋光嗣、景潤澄等曰：「宗儔教我殺爾曹，今日無患矣。」光嗣輩俯伏泣謝。宗弼子承班聞之，謂人曰：「吾家難乎免矣。」"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v273",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v273-p54",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "7d24674c35ebbd12e42525d2d42e5f4f238dec3d2b72bbcb0f373411ce865327",
          "excerpt": "帝復遣使者李彥稠入蜀，九月，己亥，至成都。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v273",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v273-p3",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "ba48b26f68f94401dc342e313de95d5056c25c9314ccba58cf4eaf3e49937d68",
          "excerpt": "莊宗光聖神閔孝皇帝中同光二年（甲申，公元九二四年）"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v039",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v039-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "af57f4540adad0b9f1892c3774e05996e54ae4e65907abe87f48c9377caf37e3",
          "excerpt": "宗弼謂樞密使宋光嗣、景潤澄等曰：“宗儔屬我除爾曹，今無患矣。”光嗣等伏泣謝。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "杀宋之谋是王宗弼转述，未据此断定宗俦确有独立杀令，更不能写宋光嗣杀宗俦。",
        "庚戌属于宗俦死亡记日，不移作宋光嗣伏谢确日。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "former-shu-song-guangsi-ten-in-place-satire",
      "title": "成为《十在文》讥刺对象",
      "summary": "顾在珣嘱林罕作《十在文》进献，其中讥刺宋光嗣摧挫英雄、贿赂用事及轻断性命；这些指责按文章的声音保存。",
      "year": 925,
      "sortOrder": 7,
      "precision": "year",
      "sourceDate": "《十国春秋》咸康元年，文末所记进献事未独记日",
      "phase": "service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v043",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v043-p11",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c21a79857f1e9f45a0ef63ae4a415cd69687fdcfc4d983d7fc43585f2fea4859",
          "excerpt": "咸康元年，後主忽舉觴不悦曰：“北有後唐，南有蠻詔，朕既不能弔伐，是所憂也。”"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v043",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v043-p11",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c21a79857f1e9f45a0ef63ae4a415cd69687fdcfc4d983d7fc43585f2fea4859",
          "excerpt": "退而屬罕著十在文以進曰："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v043",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v043-p11",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c21a79857f1e9f45a0ef63ae4a415cd69687fdcfc4d983d7fc43585f2fea4859",
          "excerpt": "摧挫英雄，吹揚佞媚；全無才智，繆處腹心；斷性命於戲玩之間，戮仇讎於樞機之下；有功勞而皆棄，非賄賂而不行，有宋光嗣在。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v037",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v037-p8",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "455767cdf1721aa8b31f71f4eea5e1a58184d2d151b35283a8dc038aac9423f5",
